<a class="mention" href="/u/woozynate">@WoozyNate</a> shares his story about developing the popular new game <a href="https://www.roblox.com/games/16732694052/Fisch">Fisch</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/2025-community-apprenticeship-product-design-applications-now-open/3269583"><strong>2025 Community Apprenticeship Product Design: Applications Now Open!</strong></a></p>
<ul>
<li>The Product Design Apprenticeship is a 12-week paid internship opportunity starting in summer 2025, located at Roblox HQ in San Mateo, CA.</li>
</ul>
